{"id":"ventana","lemma":"ventana","pos":"noun","rank":772,"glosses":["window (opening for light and air)","window frame","window (area on a computer screen)"],"ipa":"/benˈtana/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ventanas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ventana.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él rompió la ventana.","en":"He broke the window.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734518"},{"text":"Las ventanas están abiertas.","en":"The windows are open.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/63621"},{"text":"Tom cerró la ventana.","en":"Tom shut the window.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/162870"},{"text":"Cierra todas las ventanas.","en":"Close all the windows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454272"},{"text":"Mira por la ventana.","en":"Look out your window.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453245"}]}